  id: tutorial.turn_and_brake
  title: Turn and Brake
  description: A and D steer your skis. Those same inputs also become your main braking
    tools.
  autoAccept: 0
  tutorialQuest: 1
  stages:
  - id: tutorial.turn_and_brake.stage1
    title: One Pair of Inputs, Three Uses
    description: Use single-ski pressure to carve, both skis together to wedge, and
      S plus a hard turn to stop quickly.
    objectives:
    - id: tutorial.turn_and_brake.turn
      title: Carve with A or D
      description: Press A or D while moving to arc across the slope and feel the
        edge bite.
